# BF2026 R126 — isolated site read-only provider verification config.
# This file contains paths and flags ONLY, NEVER a credential.
# Do not source into production or copy a secret value to GitHub.
# Existing live site checkout must remain HOLD.
BF2026_R126_PROVIDER_VERIFY_ENABLED=0
BF2026_R126_NATIVE_OBSERVER_ENABLED=0
BF2026_R126_CTA_KEYS=
# After owner has securely provisioned a GetCourse API key restricted to
# "Read only", set ONLY the path below in a non-public server environment:
# BF2026_GETCOURSE_SECRET_FILE=/srv/factory-scratch/bf2026-r118-relay-stage-20261119/private-credentials/getcourse-readonly.json
# Native independent read-only observer requires an audited local transport
# module at the fixed private path observer-transport-approved.cjs.
# The observer's public key also stays on the private server:
# BF2026_R126_OBSERVER_PUBLIC_KEY_FILE=/srv/factory-scratch/bf2026-r118-relay-stage-20261119/private-credentials/observer-ed25519-public.pem
# Even with every flag set to 1, R126 does NOT turn on public purchases.
# Native receipt, two grants, provider-side consent and owner release remain
# separate mandatory proof gates.
